Track 1: Seven Seconds Behind The Sundial
- Story & Context: Near the oasis of Ouro, Xyl realized the salvage-clock had stopped just as the dust storm swallowed their camp. He tried to tune the oscillator to the rhythm of the wind, but the internal gear-rot forced the M1 to scream in jagged, metallic gasps. "The gears are choking on the light!" he yelled as his keyboard began to spark, sealing their fate to the nomadic path forever.
